    2. Pick color from {green, yellow, pink, teal} determining direction
    3. Compute destination position flush with that edge (row or col free within valid range 0..7)
    4. Place 3x3 hollow square at destination to form the output
    5. To derive input, pick an original position along the movement axis at distance 3-5 from the edge (same row for left/right, same col for up/down)
    6. Input is all-black grid with sprite at that original position
